<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts have sentenced six French nationals to life imprisonment and a seventh to 15 years for Islamic State membership, while another court imposed lengthy terms on seven French citizens for the same crime. Security forces have repeatedly intercepted unidentified drones over Baghdad's Green Zone, with multiple incidents reported. Yazidi militia units linked to the PKK are disarming and joining the Iraqi army, and three militia groups have pledged to disarm by June 2027. Iran has intensified rhetoric warning the United States, and the United States has warned Baghdad it will strike Iraqi militias that join Iran's war. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPYkhmalFRdENNRjZyNC1rSjQ3ZmhlTXVfT0l0SUJyOFNyTFk4am94U3BBZFZFdlFQOGZxSVl3SWp3S09iWmxUXzFkaXFBeWFlZE5Ed3F4UTZyaUJYMTNFNkpYTlBkNWJnTHVTRG9Ud2l1Sl9xakRLMlh1bnJiOG1Tc2pUWWFsS0VjV3dvbm9leGpSdVlaNlc0dmpWVjc5NFZDczdOaXcwQnBId29DTHhIVkRTaHA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeDJKUHdzbXB2am5BNmlYYnJsWlo3YjZSSGJBTlN5NVRNQkVJR2c5YUpIclBrYW9kaDkwcHZGYVcyS0N4X0I0UWtZblVndmRIaEVXSjNEYUw4ZE1Mc2pmVzIycWFwY2dCbnJLRWNwejFtMHNzQWpjYm9qZVZ3a2Zhdk1MLTI4cE42Q2ViQXdLV1RYV29GMlEyMnMyX0dfSEh3azVsMGdsV0VaT3l1Rm9wNXFOb3lBdElzME96a0h4d3IzTEF3ZXEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNd3diR0NyX0hNdXhLdktmb3J1bXZwYjBHd3k3XzlRQ1dBU29nd1BxYlh2aWREUGVBNjdiN011Q3RvM0UtRjVjVDAzbDVLZFNWSmprcVAzc3FKaWxXY05laEhQQllPTUNpYk1OQXRkWS1mb2xOOUY0Q3NSZUxFazdlSV9EOFNyclNWSUl1UTVSUjMzZFlvTz